        "name": "Invite Customer to Webinar",
        "notes[0].content": "This functional block handles the collection and processing of customer information required for webinar registration.\n\n**Purpose**: Prepare and validate customer data inputs before sending to the Microsoft Teams webinar API.\n\n**Key Data Processing**:\n- **First Name**: Extracted from workflow context ({{ CTX.first_name }})\n- **Last Name**: Extracted from workflow context ({{ CTX.last_name }})\n- **Email Address**: Extracted from workflow context ({{ CTX.email }})\n- **Company Name**: Extracted from workflow context ({{ CTX.company_name }})\n\n**Data Transformation**:\n- Maps customer data to Microsoft Teams API format using predefined question fields\n- Structures data according to Teams webinar attendee registration schema\n- Applies timezone configuration (Eastern Time UTC-05:00)\n- Sets language preference to English (en-gb)\n\n**Input Requirements**:\nThe workflow expects these context variables to be populated:\n- `first_name`: Customer's first name\n- `last_name`: Customer's last name  \n- `email`: Customer's email address\n- `company_name`: Customer's organization name\n\n**Connection to Next Block**: Processed customer data is formatted and passed to the API Integration block for webinar registration.",
        "notes[0].metadata": {
          "x": 217.9999713290842,
          "y": 205.99996161847668,
          "fill": "rgba(66, 158, 255, 0.05)",
          "width": 391,
