        "notes[0].title": "Customer Data Processing & Validation",
        "notes[1].content": "This functional block manages the secure integration with Microsoft Teams webinar registration API.\n\n**Purpose**: Execute the webinar registration by sending formatted customer data to Microsoft Teams via authenticated API call.\n\n**API Configuration**:\n- **Endpoint**: Microsoft Teams webinar attendee registration API\n- **Method**: POST request to register new attendee\n- **Authentication**: Uses X-Skypetoken header for secure API access\n- **Content Type**: JSON payload format\n- **Timeout**: 5-second timeout for reliable response handling\n\n**Security Features**:\n- Authenticated API calls using Microsoft Teams token\n- Secure HTTPS communication\n- Proper content-type headers for data integrity\n- Redirect handling enabled for API endpoint changes\n\n**API Payload Structure**:\n- Sends customer information as structured Questions array\n- Includes timezone and localization settings\n- Maps internal field names to Teams API requirements:\n  - PredefinedQuestionFirstName \u2192 Customer first name\n  - PredefinedQuestionLastName \u2192 Customer last name\n  - PredefinedQuestionEmail \u2192 Customer email\n  - Organization \u2192 Customer company name\n\n**Error Handling**:\n- 5-second timeout prevents hanging requests\n- HTTP redirect following enabled for endpoint flexibility\n- Standard HTTP status code handling\n\n**Expected Output**: API response confirming successful webinar registration or error details for troubleshooting.",
        "notes[1].metadata": {
